Description: AI coding agents - transcripts, MCP servers, hooks, rules, state DBs and logs (Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, Cursor, GitHub Copilot CLI, VS Code Copilot Chat, Gemini CLI, Antigravity, Windsurf, Cline)
